===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|ar|إِحْرَام||prohibition}}
{{root|en|ar|ح ر م}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|Islam}} The state of [[ritual]] [[purity]] and [[dedication]] of a [[Muslim]] [[hajj]] [[pilgrim]] to [[Mecca]].
# {{lb|en|Islam}} The [[clothing]] worn on such a [[pilgrimage]]; one length of [[cotton]] [[cloth]] around the [[loins]] and another thrown over the [[left]] [[shoulder]].

